### Task 4.1: JSON Export
- [ ] Create `src/output/json.rs`
- [ ] Define serializable structures with `serde`
- [ ] Implement JSON formatter using `serde_json`
- [ ] Include metadata (scan time, target, parameters)
- [ ] Support pretty-print and compact formats
