## Summary

**Total Estimated Time**: ~140-150 hours (4-5 weeks full-time)

**Critical Path**:
1. Phase 1 (Setup & CLI) → Phase 2 (Scanner) → Phase 3 (Output) → Phase 4 (MVP)
2. Testing throughout
3. Documentation & release

**Priority Order**:
1. Core scanner functionality (Phases 1-4)
2. Testing and quality assurance
3. Documentation
4. Optimization and advanced features (Phase 5)
5. Release preparation

**MVP Milestone**: End of Phase 4 (Week 3-4)
**Production Release**: End of Phase 5 + Testing + Docs (Week 5)
